entsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Rank:</b> 3 - Ensih<br /> <b>Power:</b> 6, <b>Finesse:</b> 8 , <b>Resistance:</b> 8<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 11<br /> <b>Willpower: </b>10<br /> <b>Essence:</b> 20<br /> <b>Initiative: </b><br /> <b>Defense:</b> <br /> <b>Speed:</b> 21<br /> <b>Size:</b> 3<br /> <b>Influences:</b> Crows 1, Knowledge 2<br /> <b>Aspiration:</b> Protect the Temple in Uppsala or add more knowledge to the hoard in Temple<br /> <b>Manifestation:</b> Twilight Form, Discorporate, Shadow Gateway, Image, Fetter.<br /> <b>Numina:</b> Implant Mission, Innocuous, Seek, Sign.<br /> \u200b</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Ban: </b>Can\u2019t refuse a knowledge or memory<br /> <b>Bane:</b> A flagstaff from burned <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raven_banner\" target=\"_blank\">Raven Banner</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Notice: As you can see, I would appreciate some Ban &amp; Bane help on ours.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-19-2018, 08:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T09:08:36-08:00","id":1174564,"title":"","content":"You might check <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/475614-tell-us-about-your-totem\">this thread</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T10:08:55-08:00","id":1174575,"title":"","content":"<b><u>The Cat that Prowls on the Pathways</u></b><br /> <b>Rank 2</b>: Ensih<br /> <b>Power</b>: 6,<b> Finesse</b>: 8, <b>Resistance</b>: 6<br /> <b>Willpower</b>: 10<br /> <b>Essence</b>: 20<br /> <b>Initiative</b>: 14<br /> <b>Defense</b>: 6<br /> <b>Speed</b>: 22 (species factor 8)<br /> <b>Size</b>: 5<br /> <b>Corpus</b>: 11<br /> <b>Influences</b>: Felines 2, Hunters 1<br /> <b>Aspiration</b>: Remain dominant predator in your territory for an entire season.<br /> <b>Numina</b>: Twilight Form, Discorporate, Materialize, Gauntlet Breach, Awe, Wound (Like Blast numen, but works with close combat attacks,the spirit increases the size of its claws and fangs better to rip apart its prey), Speed, Innocuous, Path Finder.<br /> <b>Bonuses</b>: Dexterity +1 (given), Direction Sense Merit.<br /> <b>Ban</b>: Cannot resist stalking a prey , when a chance is resisted and fails, the spirit becomes obssessed with hunting and cannot take any other action.<br /> <b>Bane</b>: Weapons made by sharpened rock.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Strider of Storms</b></u><br /> <b>Rank 3</b>: Hursah<br /> <b>Power</b>: 4,<b> Finesse</b>: 3,<b> Resistance</b>: 3<br /> <b>Willpower</b>: 6<br /> <b>Essence</b>: 15<br /> <b>Initiative</b>: 6<br /> <b>Defense</b>: 3<br /> <b>Speed</b>: 19 (species factor 12)<br /> <b>Size</b>: 7<br /> <b>Corpus</b>: 10<br /> <b>Influences</b>: Lightning 1, Horses 1<br /> <b>Aspiration</b>: Hunt successfully in a stormy night.<br /> <b>Numina</b>: Twilight Form, Matrialize, Discorporate, Speed, Unleash Heavens, Lighting Charge (spend a number of essence max rank+2, and make a charge attack, enemies gain a penalty to all attack rolls and the damage of the charge increases by +2 Lethal for ever essence spent and causes electrocution and stun tilts, the charm lasts untill the spirit stops running)<br /> <b>Bonuses</b>: Fleet of Foot 3<br /> <b>Ban</b>:Cannot stand closed spaces and lose one Willpower per turn while caged or restrained. Failing to break free for a number of turns equal to Resistance trait makes the totem spirit frenzy and attack all in sigh till it feels free gain. While in frenzy it will not lose further willpower. If it loses all willpower before frenzy it falls dormant.<br /> <b>Bane</b>:Chain made of Amber","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 01-09-2018, 02:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T10:22:18-08:00","id":1174577,"title":"","content":"<b>General topic advice - Can we use Rank numbers in stats?</b> It would make it easier to read entries - I still get myself wonder what particular term means in mechanics. <b>We could easily just make double convention - number <i>and</i> Fist Tongue name of Rank.</b> Here is simple table to read and past in your descriptions:<br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span 