historic mist-wrapped wolf with crimson eyes and the bloody line of tears down it's face which leave a red trail which dissipates after some minutes, an Ancestor Spirit keyed to avenge it's family and my Storm Lord's spiritual touchstone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12191,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","user":"Malus","date":". 01-09-2018, 02:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-09T11:17:53-08:00","id":1174599,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> one more <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b><u>Splintered Jaws</u></b><br /> Rank 2: Ensih<br /> Power: 5, Finesse:4 , Resistance:5<br /> Willpower: 9<br /> Essence:15<br /> Initiative: 9<br /> Defense: 4<br /> Speed: 17 (species factor 8)<br /> Size: 5<br /> Corpus: 10<br /> Influences: Dogs 1, Protection 1<br /> Aspiration: Make someone under your protection to feel safe<br /> Numina: Twilight Form, Materialize, Discorporate, Reaching, Path Finder, Awe, Regenerate, Seek<br /> Bonuses: Iron Stamina 3<br /> Ban:Cannot pass a road that is occupied by moving cars.<br /> Bane: Being hit by a moving car the spirit takes aggravated damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/mem